<TextPage title="Privacy policy" description="A straightforward overview of privacy on the God First Deals website."><div class="prose"><p><b>Last updated: 16 November 2026</b></p><h2>Information we collect</h2><p>This site is designed to let you browse without creating an account. We do not currently provide account registration, a newsletter, or an on-site checkout. If you email us, we receive the information you include in your message.</p><h2>Cookies and analytics</h2><p>We have not integrated analytics or advertising tracking in this version of the site. Our hosting provider and external services may process technical information needed to deliver pages. Their policies apply to that processing.</p><h2>External links</h2><p>Product and retailer links take you to third-party websites. Those sites have their own privacy policies and practices. We are not responsible for how third parties process your information.</p><h2>Your choices and contact</h2><p>You can choose not to follow external links and can contact us with privacy questions at <a href="mailto:hello@godfirstdeals.com">hello@godfirstdeals.com</a>.</p><p>This policy may be updated as the site evolves. Future analytics, contact forms, or account features will require this notice to be reviewed.</p></div></TextPage>
